{
  "articles": [
    {
      "id": "co-01-forms",
      "title": "Step 1: The conditional: forms",
      "fr": "le conditionnel présent : les formes",
      "level": "A2",
      "keywords": [
        "step by step",
        "conditional",
        "conditionnel",
        "would",
        "je voudrais",
        "je serais",
        "forms"
      ],
      "topics": [],
      "see": [
        "conditionnel",
        "futur-simple"
      ],
      "tense": "conditionnel-present",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "In short",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "en": "The *conditionnel présent* means **would**: I would do = *je ferais*. Take the **future stem** (usually the infinitive) and add the **imparfait endings**: *-ais, -ais, -ait, -ions, -iez, -aient*."
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "verb": "parler",
              "tense": "conditionnel-present"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Regular verbs",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "en": "*-er* and *-ir* verbs keep the whole infinitive: *je parlerais, je finirais*. *-re* verbs drop the final *e*: *prendre → je prendrais, écrire → j'écrirais*."
            },
            {
              "type": "check",
              "item": {
                "type": "form",
                "verb": "finir",
                "tense": "conditionnel-present",
                "person": 0
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Irregular stems",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "en": "The irregular stems are the same as in the futur simple. Learn these:"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "head": [
                "verb",
                "stem",
                "je"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "être",
                  "ser-",
                  "je serais"
                ],
                [
                  "avoir",
                  "aur-",
                  "j'aurais"
                ],
                [
                  "aller",
                  "ir-",
                  "j'irais"
                ],
                [
                  "faire",
