    {
      "id": "co-03-si-imparfait",
      "title": "Step 3: If I had, I would: si + imparfait",
      "fr": "si + imparfait, conditionnel",
      "level": "A2",
      "levelTo": "B1",
      "keywords": [
        "step by step",
        "si",
        "if",
        "si j'avais",
        "si j'étais",
        "imparfait",
        "conditionnel",
        "hypothesis",
        "if I were"
      ],
      "topics": [],
      "see": [
        "si-clauses",
        "imparfait",
        "conditionnel"
      ],
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "In short",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "en": "To imagine something that is **not true now**: **si + imparfait**, then the **conditionnel** in the other half. *Si j'avais de l'argent, j'achèterais un vélo.* Never put the conditional right after *si*."
            },
            {
              "type": "pattern",
              "rows": [
                {
                  "parts": [
                    [
                      "conj",
                      "Si"
                    ],
                    [
                      "S",
                      "j'"
                    ],
                    [
                      "V",
                      "avais"
                    ],
                    [
                      "obj",
                      "de l'argent,"
                    ],
                    [
                      "S",
                      "j'"
                    ],
                    [
                      "V",
                      "achèterais"
                    ],
                    [
                      "obj",
                      "un vélo."
                    ]
                  ],
                  "en": "If I had money, I would buy a bike."
                }
              ],
              "formula": [
                [
                  "conj",
                  "si"
                ],
                "S",
                [
                  "V",
                  "imparfait"
                ],
                "S",
                [
                  "V",
                  "conditionnel"
                ]
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "The pattern",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "table",
              "head": [
                "si + imparfait",
                "conditionnel"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Si j'avais le temps,",
                  "je viendrais."
                ],
                [
                  "Si nous étions riches,",
                  "nous voyagerions."
                ],
                [
                  "S'il faisait beau,",
                  "on irait à la plage."
                ],
                [
                  "Si tu étudiais,",
                  "tu aurais de meilleures notes."
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "check",
              "item": {
                "type": "cloze",
                "fr": "Si j'___ le temps, je viendrais.",
                "a": [
                  "avais"
                ],
                "hint": "avoir",
                "en": "If I had time, I would come."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Either order",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "en": "The *si* part can also come second, usually without a comma: *Je viendrais si j'avais le temps.*"
            },
            {
              "type": "check",
              "item": {
                "type": "cloze",
                "fr": "Je t'aiderais si je ___.",
                "a": [
                  "pouvais"
                ],
                "hint": "pouvoir",
                "en": "I'd help you if I could."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "If I were you",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "en": "*Si j'étais toi...* or simply *À ta place...* (in your place), then the conditional: *À ta place, je partirais.*"
            },
            {
              "type": "check",
              "item": {
                "type": "build",
                "en": "If I were you, I would sleep.",
                "a": [
                  "Si j'étais toi, je dormirais.",
                  "À ta place, je dormirais."
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Watch out",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "compare",
              "items": [
                {
                  "en": "If I had time...",
                  "wrong": "Si j'aurais le temps...",
                  "fr": "Si j'[[avais]] le temps...",
                  "note": "never the conditional after si"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tip",
              "en": "*Si* + *il / ils* becomes **s'il, s'ils**. *Si* + *elle* stays: *si elle venait*."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Examples",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "examples",
              "items": [
                {
                  "fr": "Si j'étais plus grand, je jouerais au basket.",
                  "en": "If I were taller, I would play basketball."
                },
                {
                  "fr": "Si tu habitais à Prague, on se verrait plus souvent.",
                  "en": "If you lived in Prague, we'd see each other more often."
                },
                {
                  "fr": "Qu'est-ce que tu ferais si tu gagnais au loto ?",
                  "en": "What would you do if you won the lottery?"
                },
                {
                  "fr": "S'il ne pleuvait pas, on jouerait dehors.",
                  "en": "If it wasn't raining, we'd play outside."
                },
                {
                  "fr": "À ta place, je dirais la vérité.",
                  "en": "If I were you, I'd tell the truth."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
