      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "In short",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "en": "To imagine a **different past**: **si + plus-que-parfait**, then the **conditionnel passé**. *Si j'avais su, je serais venu.* = If I had known, I would have come."
            },
            {
              "type": "pattern",
              "rows": [
                {
                  "parts": [
                    [
                      "conj",
                      "Si"
                    ],
                    [
                      "S",
                      "j'"
                    ],
                    [
